QuestGuidance.Register("en",241,{
[7681]="700718E9\n1\tExamine weathered markings\030Investigate old cloth\030Look at the broken statue\tMáladil is studying the Elderwell and has asked for your help searching the ruins for signs of the Ishâkhai.\n2\tReturn to Máladil with your findings\tYou have searched the Elderwell for signs of the Ishâkhai. Return to Máladil to inform her of your findings.\n",
[7682]="7007161E\n1\tTalk to Hidâti\tYou will need Hidâti's help to banish Ishími, the Anguished Wind. You should talk to Hidâti.\n2\tPlace Kâparai wards (total: 5)\030Heal frightened Aradûni (total: 7)\tHidâti has a plan to banish Ishími, the Anguished Wind from the Dawn-warden. You should place Kâparai wards and heal the spirits of frightened Aradûni with Hidâti.\n3\tTalk to Hidâti\tIshími has become enraged by your attempts to banish it. You should talk to Hidâti.\n4\tFind the cyclone of wind\tIshími has begun manifesting near the statue of Izighûz Menûndari. You should find the cyclone of wind near the statue.\n5\tBanish Ishími, the Anguished Wind\030(Optional) Place the final Kâparai ward\tYou must defeat the coalesced form of Ishími, the Anguished Wind to banish it from the Dawn-warden! You must place the final Kâparai ward near the cyclone to confront Ishími.\n6\tTalk to Hidâti\tIshími has successfully been banished. You should talk to Hidâti.\n7\tTalk to Captain Hanâbu\tIshími has successfully been banished. You should talk to Captain Hanâbu.\n",
[7683]="700356A7\n1\tTalk to Frithwyn\tThe surviving refugees are in their cave north of Byre Tor. You should speak to the refugees about the situation at hand.\n2\tSpeak with Ránmald\tRánmald is in the cave amongst the other women of Byre Tor, who have promised to treat her more kindly. You should speak with Ránmald.\n",
[7684]="70032161\n1\tFind the camp of Isteron's friends on Parth Galen\tIsteron's friends are camped on Parth Galen, a grassy lawn to the south-east of the Under-wall tunnels, by a stream that runs from the lake of Nen Hithoel.\n",
[7685]="7006D137\n1\tDestroy fortifications at Ghât Lor (total: 7)\tDestroy fortifications at Ghât Lor. Ghât Lor can be found to the east of Vartúlin.\n2\tReturn to Artar Ildarthos at Vartúlin\tReturn to Artar Ildarthos at Vartúlin.\n",
[7686]="70068BB5\n1\tDefeat spiders east of the city (total: 6)\030Collect Usham's satchel where he dropped it east of the city\tUsham ran afoul of spiders to the east of the city, and he asked for your help recovering the satchel he dropped here when he fled.\n2\tBring the satchel to Usham outside the Dampstone Inn\tUsham is outside the Dampstone Inn.\n3\tPlace Usham's satchel down on the table outside the inn\tUsham asked you to set his satchel down on the table outside the inn.\n4\tTalk to Usham outside the Dampstone Inn\tUsham is not happy.\n5\tLeave Usham's satchel in the wild north-east of the Dampstone Inn\tUsham no longer wants his satchel, and has asked you to leave it outside the city. Just to the north-east of the Dampstone Inn should be far enough.\n6\tReturn to Usham outside the Dampstone Inn\tNow that you have done as he asked, you should return to Usham outside the Dampstone Inn.\n7\tTalk to Maisha outside the Dampstone Inn\tMaisha has called for your attention outside the Dampstone Inn.\n",
[7687]="70017D86\n1\tTalk to Mayor Will Whitfoot\030Collect Ithildín Coin\030Talk to Jon Brackenbrook\030Talk to Dwalin\030Talk to Barliman Butterbur\030Talk to Cardavor\tBring your ithildín coin to one of the following people to receive a reward. • Jon Brackenbrook in Archet • Dwalin in Thorin's Hall • Mayor Will Whitfoot in Michel Delving • Barliman Butterbur in Bree-town • Cardavor in Celondim\n",
[7688]="700187CF\n1\tTalk to Mayor Will Whitfoot\030Collect Ithildín Coin\030Talk to Jon Brackenbrook\030Talk to Dwalin\030Talk to Barliman Butterbur\030Talk to Cardavor\tBring your ithildín coin to one of the following people to receive a reward. • Jon Brackenbrook in Archet • Dwalin in Thorin's Hall • Mayor Will Whitfoot in Michel Delving • Barliman Butterbur in Bree-town • Cardavor in Celondim\n",
[7689]="700187D0\n1\tTalk to Mayor Will Whitfoot\030Collect Ithildín Coin\030Talk to Jon Brackenbrook\030Talk to Dwalin\030Talk to Barliman Butterbur\030Talk to Cardavor\tBring your ithildín coin to one of the following people to receive a reward. • Jon Brackenbrook in Archet • Dwalin in Thorin's Hall • Mayor Will Whitfoot in Michel Delving • Barliman Butterbur in Bree-town • Cardavor in Celondim\n",
[7690]="700187D1\n1\tTalk to Mayor Will Whitfoot\030Collect Ithildín Coin\030Talk to Jon Brackenbrook\030Talk to Dwalin\030Talk to Barliman Butterbur\030Talk to Cardavor\tBring your ithildín coin to one of the following people to receive a reward. • Jon Brackenbrook in Archet • Dwalin in Thorin's Hall • Mayor Will Whitfoot in Michel Delving • Barliman Butterbur in Bree-town • Cardavor in Celondim\n",
[7691]="700187D2\n1\tTalk to Mayor Will Whitfoot\030Collect Ithildín Coin\030Talk to Jon Brackenbrook\030Talk to Dwalin\030Talk to Barliman Butterbur\030Talk to Cardavor\tBring your ithildín coin to one of the following people to receive a reward. • Jon Brackenbrook in Archet • Dwalin in Thorin's Hall • Mayor Will Whitfoot in Michel Delving • Barliman Butterbur in Bree-town • Cardavor in Celondim\n",
[7692]="700187D3\n1\tTalk to Mayor Will Whitfoot\030Collect Ithildín Coin\030Talk to Jon Brackenbrook\030Talk to Dwalin\030Talk to Barliman Butterbur\030Talk to Cardavor\tBring your ithildín coin to one of the following people to receive a reward. • Jon Brackenbrook in Archet • Dwalin in Thorin's Hall • Mayor Will Whitfoot in Michel Delving • Barliman Butterbur in Bree-town • Cardavor in Celondim\n",
[7693]="7000075C\n1\tDeliver Ivar's Helm to Radagast at the Eglan-camp\030Collect Ivar's helm (quantity: see journal)\tIvar may be found in Garth Agarwen in Agamaur, within the Lone-lands. Radagast is unable to directly interfere in the war by seeking out and destroying Ivar the Bloodhand. He has asked you to go in his stead and to bring him Ivar's helm as proof of your victory.\n",
[7694]="70020BAE\n1\tTalk to a Ranger at Echad Idhrenfair\tThere are Rangers at Echad Idhrenfair in the Gloomglens. You should bring the boar-tusks you harvested to one of the Rangers of the Grey Company as evidence of the threats posed to them in the Gloomglens.\n",
[7695]="70066939\n1\tComplete 'Vineyard Pests'\030Complete 'A Delivery for the Cooper'\030Complete 'Fence Repair'\030Complete 'The Crows of Iáphel'\tMiruhir has asked you to help with many tasks around the vineyard. Complete quests in and around Iáphel.\n2\tTalk to Miruhir\tYou have completed all the tasks that Miruhir gave you. Speak with him in Iáphel.\n",
[7696]="70066922\n1\tTalk to Derva\tMiruhir has asked you to deliver wine to his friend, Derva, at the farm to the north. Deliver wine to Derva.\n",
[7697]="7006BCF1\n1\tDefeat jackals (total: 6)\tJackals can be found to the TBD of TBD. TBD Dog Lover, a concerned citizen in Jirush, has asked you to thin the number of jackals around TBD.\n2\tReturn to TBD Dog Lover\tTBD Dog Lover can be found to the TBD of Jirush. Return to TBD Dog Lover.\n",
[7698]="70040A57\n1\tSummon and defeat Hebil\tHebil's banner is at the massacre site in southern Lamedon. You should use the battle-horn on the banner to call Hebil to battle. NOTE: Use the whistle to summon Jajax if you become separated.\n2\tSpeak with Jajax\tJajax is at the site of Hebil's massacre. You should speak with Jajax. NOTE: Use the whistle to summon Jajax if you become separated.\n3\tMourn Jajax's fallen allies\tThe site of the massacre is south-west of Calembel. You should mourn Jajax's men at the site of the massacre.\n4\tSay farewell to Jajax\tJajax stands at the site of the Corsairs' massacre, in southern Lamedon. You should say farewell to Jajax.\n",
[7699]="7004428B\n1\tCollect Sûhalar axes (total: 10)\030Collect Sûhalar metal scraps (total: 6)\tJal Vârsha can be found along the northern Rammas in southern Talath Anor. You should collect Sûhalar axes and metal in the camp for Ingold.\n2\tSpeak with Ingold\tIngold can be found at the North-gate of the Rammas. You should speak with Ingold.\n",
[7700]="7004428A\n1\tBurn Sûhalar banners (total: 8)\030Plant banners of Gondor (total: 6)\tJal Vârsha can be found along the northern Rammas in southern Talath Anor. You should burn enemy banners and plant banners of Gondor throughout the encampment.\n2\tSpeak with Ingold\tIngold can be found at the northern gate of the Rammas. You should speak with Ingold.\n",
[7701]="7004428D\n1\tDefeat Sûhalar tower guards (total: 5)\030Defeat Shurlâj\tJal Vârsha can be found along the northern Rammas in southern Talath Anor. You should defeat Sûhalar guards and their captain.\n2\tSpeak with Ingold\tIngold can be found at the northern gate of the Rammas. You should speak with Ingold.\n",
[7702]="70044287\n1\tJal Vârsha can be found along the northern Rammas in southern Talath Anor. You should free their horses.\t\n2\tDestroy tents (total: 12)\tJal Vârsha can be found along the the northern Rammas in southern Talath Anor. Now that their horses are gone, you should burn their tents.\n3\tSpeak with Ingold\tIngold can be found at the northern gate of the Rammas. You should speak with Ingold.\n",
[7703]="7004D08C\n1\tDefeat Jangovar Marauders (total: 6)\tJangovar Marauders can be found in the wilds near the city of Dale in the Dale-lands. You should defeat any Jangovar Marauders you come across.\n2\tCompleted\tDefeated many Jangovar Marauders.\n",
[7704]="700718E8\n1\tDefeat jázgai at Spoiler's Crag (total: 8)\tAndûmu is worried that the jázgai that prowl near their camp at night will soon try to rob them of their food stores. He has asked you to go to their den atop a hill south of Gadim-ûn called Spoiler's Crag and renew their fear of people.\n2\tTalk to Andûmu\tAndûmu is worried that the jázgai that prowl near their camp at night will soon try to rob them of their food stores. You defeated some of them to thin their numbers and renew their fear of people. You should return to Andûmu in Gadim-ûn.\n",
[7705]="700359A7\n1\tCraft a jewelled coin for the refugees of Wildermore (quantity: see journal)\tHildelith has given you a recipe for a jewelled coin. You should craft a jewelled coin for the impoverished refugees at Forlaw.\n2\tDeliver the jewelled coin to Hildelith\tHildelith is in Forlaw. You have crafted a jewelled coin, and should now deliver it to Hildelith.\n",
[7706]="70025A4A\n1\tCollect pieces of jewellery from crawlers (total: 10)\tCrawlers can be found in the Barandalf, south of the colossus. Herthdúr asked you to search crawlers within the Barandalf for pieces of jewellery.\n2\tBring the jewellery to Herthdúr\tHerthdúr is at the colossus, north of the Barandalf. Herthdúr will be eager to see the ancient jewellery you have reclaimed from the sands.\n",
[7707]="70025A43\n1\tFind a Ranger at the colossus camp to speak with about the ring you found\tThe colossus camp is north of the Barandalf. One of the Rangers at the colossus camp may be interested in seeing the ring you have found.\n",
[7708]="7000000A\n1\tTalk to Second Shirriff Bodo Bunce\tSecond Shirriff Bunce can be found outside Town Hole in Michel Delving. Town Hole is in a walled enclosure on the north side of town. You should speak to the Second Shirriff of the Shire Watch, Bodo Bunce, in Michel Delving, if you wish to join the Bounders.\n",
[7709]="7002718B\n1\tDefeat bugan in the mine (total: 15)\030Defeat bugan chieftain\tBugan can be found within the Barnavon Mine. Argel has asked you to enter the Barnavon Mine and defeat many of the bugan which drove them out.\n2\tTalk to Argel at the mine\tArgel is at the camp outside the Barnavon Mine. You should return to Argel with news of your deeds.\n",
[7710]="70027299\n1\tTalk to Andreg near the Slade of Shadows\tAndreg is near the Slade of Shadows, some distance to the south of the Rohirrim scout-camp. Saeradan asked you to meet with Andreg and offer him your assistance.\n",
[7711]="70058736\n1\tTalk to Skarding Wargsbane\tSkarding Wargsbane can be found on the battlefield. You should talk to Skarding Wargsbane.\n2\tSearch Howlers' Notch for Azhatar\030Use the whistle to summon Skarding if you become separated\tHowlers' Notch can be found in Elderslade. You should search Howlers' Notch with Skarding by your side.\n3\tExamine the trail of destruction\030Use the whistle to summon Skarding if you become separated\tHowlers' Notch can be found in Elderslade. Follow the travel of destruction from Howlers' Notch.\n4\tExamine the destruction\030Use the whistle to summon Skarding if you become separated\tHowlers' Notch can be found in Elderslade. Follow the travel of destruction from Howlers' Notch.\n5\tContinue following the trail\030Use the whistle to summon Skarding if you become separated\tHowlers' Notch can be found in Elderslade. Follow the travel of destruction from Howlers' Notch.\n6\tExamine the dead dwarf\030Use the whistle to summon Skarding if you become separated\tHowlers' Notch can be found in Elderslade. Follow the travel of destruction from Howlers' Notch.\n7\tExamine where the trail of destruction ends\030Defeat Azhatarg\030Use the whistle to summon Skarding if you become separated\tHowlers' Notch can be found in Elderslade. Follow the travel of destruction from Howlers' Notch.\n8\tTalk to Skarding Wargsbane\030Use the whistle to summon Skarding if you become separated\tTalk to Skarding Wargsbane.\n9\tTalk to Skarding Wargsbane at Shakal-atrâd\tSkarding Wargsbane can be found at Shakal-atrâd. You should talk to Skarding Wargsbane.\n",
[7712]="70071B3A\n1\tTravel to Jiret-menêsh\tJiret-menêsh is located in north-western An Shêru, atop a mountain peak.\n2\tTalk to the guard\tAs you approached the entrance to Jiret-menêsh, a guard asked you to stop. You should talk to her.\n3\tTalk to Mêshaget\tAs you began to speak with the guard, Mêshaget and Khagâmi arrived behind you. You should talk to Mêshaget.\n",
})
